		<!-- 地图类型描述 -->
		<Row Tag="LOC_MAP_RR_CONTINENTS_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>M0 development map. Vanilla Continents generation pipeline (continents, terrain, rivers, lakes, features, resources, starting plots) wrapped in the Real Geography framework. Real-elevation and 1:4 grid work lands in later milestones.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MAP_RR_CONTINENTS_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>M0 开发用地图。在"地大物博"框架内复用原版大陆生成流程（海陆、地形、河流、湖泊、地貌、资源、出生点），保证可加载可开局。真实海拔与 1:4 网格将在后续里程碑加入。</Text>
		</Row>

